  "problem": "If $\\,T\\,$ is a linear transformation and $\\,T([\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}])=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -11\\end{aligned}]$, then find $T([\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}]).$\n\n| $\\,T([\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}])=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |",
